~ start

if shrine_repaired
	=> mayor_arrested

if not prisoners_encountered
	=> first_encounter
	
if not has_wallet and has_candy:
	=> got_candy
	
if has_wallet and not has_candy:
	=> got_wallet
	
if has_wallet and has_candy:
	=> got_both
	
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: You gotta admit, those tiny dinos look delicious.
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: I hope they never let you out of here.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Yowch! Hurtful.
=> END

~ got_candy
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: I can't believe it! You got the snacks! See Terry! I told you dinos can be alright!
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: *Grumbles*
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Now, don't forget, you gotta get Terry's wallet too. Where'd you say you left it?
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: In the museum.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: In the museum! You got this kid. Just one more thing and that password is yours!
do remove_item("DinoSnacks")
=> END

~ got_wallet
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: My wallet! Hot dog! I wasn't sure I'd ever get this back.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: I can't believe you got his thing first! Do you know how hungry I-
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Peck.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Ahem. Sorry, I get a little crabby when I'm hungry. 
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Good work kid. Just go get this psycho's candy and I'll give you the password.
do remove_item("Wallet")
=> END

~ got_both
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Hot dog! He's done it!
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: He really did do it...
Terry: I can't tell you how much this picture means to me. 
Terry: I had absolutely no faith in you kid, but you proved me wrong.
Terry: A deal's a deal.
Terry: The password to the clubhouse is...
set voice_pitch = 0
Terry: [wave]"Roar"[wave]
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Wait really? That's it?
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: The guy who comes up with the passwords isn't very creative. Last week it was "Grrr".
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Well in any case, I can't thank ya enough kid. Hope that password does you some good!
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Ditto. Good luck out there.
set has_candy = false
set has_wallet = false
set knows_password = true
do remove_item("DinoSnacks")
do remove_item("Wallet")
=> END

~ first_encounter
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Hey Terry, check it out! We got a visitor.
set voice_pitch = 0.1
if player_clothed
	Terry: Forget it, he's a dino. He ain't gonna be any help.
else
	Terry: Peck. He's naked. In public. 
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Don't be like that, we haven't even talked to the guy!
Peck: Nice to meet ya, I'm Peck, and this large pterosaur fellow you see before you is Terry.
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: *Grumbles*
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: As you can see, we're in a bit of a bind right now.
Peck: Ever since Mayor Bronto took office, pterosaurs have been gettin' rounded up for made-up crimes. 
Peck: Terry just got busted for walkin' down the street! How ridiculous is that?
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Now tell him why you're in here.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: I don't see how that's relevant...
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: He tried to eat a microraptor.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: [wave]Allegedly[/wave] tried to eat a microraptor.
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: You've told me on multiple occasions that you think they'd be the tastiest dinosaur.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: [wave]MOVING ON![/wave]
Peck: As you can imagine, creature comforts are a scarce commodity here in the slammer.
Peck: We could really use someone like yourself to help us get a few items. 
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: We're not asking for much. I just need you to get my wallet from the museum.
Terry: I work there as a janitor and I dropped it early this morning when I got spooked by a loud noise in the foyer.
Terry: Sounded like something was crawling in the walls!
Terry: I winged it out of there and got busted on my way back home. 
Terry: There's not even any money in it. The wallet has a picture of my daughter inside...
Terry: I just want to be able to see her while I'm in here.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: And I just want a snack!
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Oh brother...
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: There's a kid who sells these dino snacks on main street. Haven't had the things in months! 
Peck: I'd really appreciate it if you could pick up a handful of those and bring em' here. 
Peck: And if ya help us out, my friend Terry here knows today's password to the [wave]clubhouse[/wave]!
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Hey man, I could get in trouble for sharing that with a stranger!
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Bring us the loot and we'll give you the key to the hottest spot in town.
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: *Sighs* Yeah. I'll tell you if you help me out.
set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Whaddya say, kid?
set voice_pitch = 0.5
Toby: ...
Toby: *Roar*
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: We're doomed.
set prisoners_encountered = true
=> END

~ mayor_arrested
set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Hey! It's you! You won't believe it!
Terry: They're investigating my arrest and I might get outta here!
Terry: I heard you had something to do with it. Thanks so much!
Terry: Maybe not all dinos are bad after all.

set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Yeah! And I'm gettin' outta here too!

set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: No, you're not. 

set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Don't say that! I'm manifestin'!
Peck: Well, I'm sad to see Terry go, but I got a new cellmate to yap with!
Peck: [wave]AIN'T THAT RIGHT MAYOR?[/wave]
Mayor: ...
Peck: Haha! Sore loser that one.

set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Anyway, thanks again. See you on the outside soon!

set voice_pitch = 0.75
Peck: Hmm... I wonder what brontosaurus tastes like...

set voice_pitch = 0.1
Terry: Stop.